{"ticker":{"symbol":"071950.KS","name":"코아스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":841.0,"change_pct":-0.06555555555555559,"market_cap":10477053952.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":6700.0,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Furnishings, Fixtures & Appliances","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":177,"website":"https://www.ikoas.com","business_summary":"KOAS Co., Ltd. produces and sells office furniture in South Korea. The company offers office furniture, including desk, panel, cabinet, executive, and conference systems; classroom, preschool, lecture room, library, dormitory, training center, laboratory, healthcare, student, and amenity furniture; executive, office, multi-use, and public chairs; and desks and tables. It also exports its products. The company was formerly known as Koaswell, Co., Ltd. and changed its name to KOAS Co., Ltd. in 2011. KOAS Co., Ltd. was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"코아스(주)는 한국에서 사무용 가구를 생산 및 판매하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 책상, 패널, 캐비닛, 임원 및 회의 시스템을 포함한 사무용 가구를 제공합니다. 교실, 유치원, 강의실, 도서관, 기숙사, 교육 센터, 실험실, 의료, 학생 및 편의 시설 가구; 임원용, 사무실용, 다목적 및 공용 의자; 그리고 책상과 테이블. 또한 자사 제품을 수출합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Koaswell, Co., Ltd.로 알려졌으며 2011년에 KOAS Co., Ltd.로 이름을 변경했습니다. KOAS Co., Ltd.는 1984년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"가구·가전","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":97886470710.0,"operating_income":-704504250.0,"net_income":-1909982360.0,"eps":-620.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":73746191890.0,"operating_income":-3034188450.0,"net_income":-6874232310.0,"eps":-2220.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":77951547760.0,"operating_income":-7244717150.0,"net_income":-8869310650.0,"eps":-2788.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":62229199780.0,"operating_income":-5680240970